flowchart LR
  Operator[Operator / approver] --> Browser[Product introduction + browser console]
  Operator --> CLI[Interactive CLI]
  Alertmanager[Prometheus Alertmanager] -->|Authenticated firing / resolved webhook| API
  Manual[Normalized alert + evidence] --> API
  Checkout[Instrumented checkout demo] --> Prometheus[Prometheus metrics + alert rules]
  Checkout --> Collector[OpenTelemetry Collector]
  Prometheus --> Alertmanager
  Collector --> Loki[Loki logs]
  Collector --> Tempo[Tempo traces]

  subgraph App[OpsPilot API process]
    ASGI[FastAPI ASGI shell]
    API[Versioned API + role, session, CSRF and input checks]
    Graph[Checkpointed LangGraph investigation]
    Tools[Incident-scoped bounded read tools]
    Diagnose[Deterministic diagnosis + explicit abstention]
    Proposal[Typed allowlisted proposal]
    Approval[Separate approver decision]
    Execute[Simulator-only execution]
    Verify[Server-owned verification]
    ASGI --> API --> Graph --> Tools --> Diagnose
    API --> Proposal --> Approval --> Execute --> Verify --> API
  end

  Browser --> ASGI
  CLI --> API
  Graph -->|Optional: candidate ranking only, consent + HTTPS| Model[OpenAI-compatible provider]
  Tools --> State
  State --> Prometheus
  State --> Loki
  State --> Tempo
  State --> Fixtures[Replay cases + normalized observations]
  MCPHost[Local MCP host] --> MCP[Stdio MCP adapter · read-only]
  MCP --> Tools

  API --> OpsDB[(Operational store · SQLite or PostgreSQL)]
  Tools --> OpsDB
  Verify --> OpsDB
  Graph --> Checkpoint[(LangGraph checkpoints · SQLite or PostgreSQL)]
  Execute -->|Eligible replay cases only| Sandbox[Seeded simulator state]

